--   1. `cl-thm-zero-radius = refl`:
--      Strict `0px` Swiss architectural geometry (`border-radius: 0`) across all `/collab` CSS rules.
--   2. `cl-thm-rejects-duplicate` & `cl-thm-accepts-next-seq`:
--      Universal `Nat` proofs that sequence-monotone peer ingestion (`seen < incoming`) accepts every
--      new collaborator packet (`suc s`) and deterministically drops duplicate re-polls (`s`),
--      eliminating 1Hz outbox timer spam and 4s heartbeat slot overwrites.
--   3. `cl-thm-strict-palette = refl`:
